#### 2.2.2 Time-of-Flight Detector (TOF)

The barrel Time-of-Flight (TOF) detector [61], consists of 120 trays, is installed just outside of STAR TPC, as one see in Figure 22. The barrel TOF detector covers a pseudo-rapidity range

