#### 3.4.3 Trigger Bias Factors (TB) are Studied from Simulation

In the simulation, the Monte Carlo (MC) events are generated by PYTHIA/HIJING for Run15 pp/pAu. These MC events are feed into the STAR GEANT detector simulator, the simulated MC signals from STAR GEANT are mixed with those from the Zero-Bias real data. In this way, the trigger bias study is done under the similar environment as the real data taken.

