\[<\epsilon>=\epsilon[k=1]*\mathrm{Frac[k=1]}+\epsilon[k=2]*\mathrm{Frac[k=2]}\]

\[<\epsilon_{\mathrm{MB}}^{\mathrm{BBC}}>=\epsilon_{\mathrm{MB}}^{\mathrm{ BBC}}[k=1]*\mathrm{Frac[k=1]}+\epsilon_{\mathrm{MB+MB}}^{\mathrm{BBC}}[k=2]* \mathrm{Frack[k=2]}\]

