* \(\Upsilon\) Templates: The default template Width and the Shift factor are obtained from the fitting of smeared signals. The smeared template rely on the fitted width and mean of real \(\mbox{J}/\psi\), so the width and mean of \(\Upsilon\) templates are varied to cover the fitted statistical uncertainty of \(\mbox{J}/\psi\) mean and width. The widths of \(\Upsilon\) templates are changed by \(\pm 5\%\), and the shift of the mean of \(\Upsilon\) templates are changed \(\pm 10\%\).
